{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44472","headline":"诗三百三首 一六九 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 一六九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侬家暂下山，入到城隍里。\n逢见一羣女，端正容貌美。\n头带蜀样花，燕脂涂粉腻。\n金钏镂银朵，罗衣绯红紫。\n朱颜类神仙，香带氛氲气。\n时人皆顾盼，痴爱染心意。\n谓言世无双，魂影随他去。\n狗齩枯骨头，虚自舐唇齿。\n不解返思量，与畜何曾异。\n今成白发婆，老陋若精魅。\n无始由狗心，不超解脱地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}